      "urpx:name": "SC1 Rate I — Full Service, resolved snapshot effective 2026-02-01",
      "urpx:description": "Fully resolved, self-contained RatePlanVersion for Consolidated Edison SC1 Rate I Full Service, consolidating three pricing inputs: delivery charges from a tariff book filing, the MAC energy charge from the monthly Statements of Monthly Adjustment Clause (applicable to SC1 because SC1 passes the charge's NOT(SC11) applicability condition), and the Market Supply Charge from a market price feed. The snapshot is readable without access to any source data: every referenced node — price definitions, ledgers, metric inputs, general rules, applicability conditions, and source citations — is carried in full, keeping the URI it was published under so provenance remains a graph walk. Prices are version-scoped copies carrying their own valid dates; the version envelope does not clip them.",
